 Set up the custom command                                                                                        5 / 7
 ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

 › Command      › mytunnel http 127.0.0.1:{port}
     {port} becomes the receiver's port. Arguments are split on spaces; no shell runs it.

   URL pattern  › https://[a-z0-9-]+\.example\.dev
     A regular expression that finds the public URL in the command's output.































